</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 485)</h2>
<p><b>Optimized marks appear as each shot finishes, not all at the end.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: during a whole-session optimize, the playlist showed no marks until the entire batch was done.</b> A twelve-shot run meant ten minutes of a playlist that looked untouched while shots were completing one by one. Each shot is marked the moment it lands.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
